ave no money to start\\nthe project.","msg_0483_T06_00002":"MACHOP: Guooh gogogoh!","msg_0483_T06_00003":"There are eight Gyms in Kanto.\\rThat big building is Vermilion’s\\nPokémon Gym.","msg_0483_T06_00004":"Skilled Trainers gather in Kanto.\\nGym Leaders are especially strong.\\rThey won’t be easy to defeat.","msg_0483_T06_00005":"You’ve started to collect Kanto\\nGym Badges?\\rDon’t you agree that the Trainers\\nhere are tough?","msg_0483_T06_00006":"I guess you’ll be finished with your\\nconquest of Kanto Gyms soon.\\rLet me know if you get all\\neight Badges.","msg_0483_T06_00007":"Congratulations!\\nYou got all the Kanto Gym Badges.\\rI’ve got a reward for your efforts.\\r","msg_0483_T06_00008":"PP Max is a powerful item that\\nraises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\\fIt can change the way you battle!","msg_0483_T06_00009":"PP Max is a powerful item that\\nraises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\\fIt can change the way you battle!","msg_0483_T06_00010":"Vermilion City\\nThe Port of Exquisite Sunsets","msg_0483_T06_00011":"Vermilion City Pokémon Gym\\nLeader: Lt. Surge\\fThe Lightning American","msg_0483_T06_00012":"Pokémon Fan Club\\nAll Pokémon Fans Welcome!","msg_0483_T06_00013":"Vermilion Port Entrance","msg_0483_T06_00014":"Eusine: That was so close!\\nI thought I could corner it by\\fambushing it here...\\rBut running on the water...\\nis beyond me.\\rStill, I am starting to see a pattern.\\fSUICUNE prefers water!\\fThat means...\\r","msg_0483_T06_00015":"Sorry, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\nI’ve got to go!\\r","msg_0483_T06_00016":"Hi!\\nMy name is Steven.\\fThe Champion from the Hoenn region.\\rHave we met...before?\\rThat’s not possible.\\nAll the Trainers I have battled\\fseem to have the same look, anyway.\\rEspecially the ones who gave me\\ntough battles...\\r","msg_0483_T06_00017":"Steven: By the way, have you heard of\\na Pokémon called LATIAS?\\rI am investigating why LATIAS,\\na Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\\fleave Hoenn to come here.\\r","msg_0483_T06_00018":"Steven: By the way, have you heard of\\na Pokémon called LATIOS?\\rI am investigating why LATIOS,\\na Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\\fleave Hoenn to come here.\\r","msg_0483_T06_00019":"LATIAS is a Pokémon that has a lot\\nto do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\\rConsidering the fact that LATIAS is now\\nin Kanto, it is possible to assume that\\fthis has to do with the Soul Dew.\\r","msg_0483_T06_00020":"LATIOS is a Pokémon that has a lot\\nto do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\\rConsidering the fact that LATIOS is now\\nin Kanto, it is possible to assume that\\fthis has to do with Soul Dew.\\r","msg_0483_T06_00021":"LATIAS is a Pokémon that travels\\na great distance.\\rIt’ll be difficult to find without any\\nmachine to track it with.\\rBut any Trainer will be drawn to it,\\nwon’t they?\\r","msg_0483_T06_00022":"LATIOS is a Pokémon that travels\\na great distance.\\rIt’ll be difficult to find without any\\nmachine to track it with.\\rBut any Trainer will be drawn to it,\\nwon’t they?\\r","msg_0483_T06_00023":"Steven: I must go.\\nMay our journeys cross again.\\r"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_4130","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_T06_013 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T06_009 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T06_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_T06_013":13,"obj_T06_gsoldman1":0,"obj_T06_gsmiddleman1":1,"obj_T06_gswoman1":2,"obj_T06_gsman1":3,"obj_T06_tsure_poke_static_machop":4,"obj_T06_breakrock":5,"obj_T06_breakrock_2":6,"obj_T06_breakrock_3":7,"obj_T06_breakrock_4":8,"obj_T06_breakrock_5":9,"obj_T06_breakrock_6":10,"obj_T06_tree":11,"obj_T06_monstarball":12,"obj_T06_monstarball_2":13,"obj_T06_gsmiddleman1_2":14,"obj_T06_tsure_poke_static_suicune":15,"obj_T06_min